OL,3,GNEWSAPlain-clothes police target repeat
OL,4,Afare dodgers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlain-clothes police officers are being
OL,7,Fdeployed on London's transport network
OL,8,Fto catch people who repeatedly push
OL,9,Fthrough ticket barriers without paying.
OL,11,FTransport for London (TfL) said 467
OL,12,Fpeople were stopped and 24 arrested in
OL,13,Fthe first month of Operation Vector, a
OL,14,Fjoint operation with British Transport
OL,15,FPolice (BTP).
OL,17,FOfficers also issued 156 penalty fares
OL,18,Fand reported 175 people for possible
OL,19,Fprosecution.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
