OL,3,GNEWSAPlain-clothes police target repeat
OL,4,Afare dodgers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfL's fare evasion rate remains at
OL,7,F3.5%, the same level seen in 2024-25,
OL,8,Fagainst a target of 1.5% by 2030-31.
OL,9,FTfL said it would "not tolerate" fare
OL,10,Fevasion, which the transport body
OL,11,Festimates costs it about #190m a year.
